"long":214.989},"text":"Now a rarer word: \"tokenization\". It's split into \"token\" and \"ization\". The model has seen both pieces many times, so it still understands the word.","words":[{"w":"Now","start":211.989},{"w":"a","start":212.309},{"w":"rarer","start":212.509},{"w":"word:","start":213.029},{"w":"\"tokenization\".","start":213.429},{"w":"It's","start":214.209},{"w":"split","start":214.989},{"w":"into","start":215.429},{"w":"\"token\"","start":215.709},{"w":"and","start":216.229},{"w":"\"ization\".","start":216.769},{"w":"The","start":217.309},{"w":"model","start":217.589},{"w":"has","start":218.069},{"w":"seen","start":218.229},{"w":"both","start":218.509},{"w":"pieces","start":218.829},{"w":"many","start":219.229},{"w":"times,","start":219.589},{"w":"so","start":220.029},{"w":"it","start":220.229},{"w":"still","start":220.429},{"w":"understands","start":220.709},{"w":"the","start":221.349},{"w":"word.","start":221.549}]},{"id":"c23","start":222.226,"end":230.729,"marks":{"straw":223.506},"text":"And here's a famous one: \"strawberry\". One tokenizer splits it into \"str\", \"aw\", \"berry\". Keep that in mind; it comes back in a minute.","words":[{"w":"And","start":222.226},{"w":"here's","start":222.306},{"w":"a","start":222.626},{"w":"famous","start":222.746},{"w":"one:","start":223.186},{"w":"\"strawberry\".","start":223.506},{"w":"One","start":224.466},{"w":"tokenizer","start":224.746},{"w":"splits","start":225.506},{"w":"it","start":225.906},{"w":"into","start":226.066},{"w":"\"str\",","start":226.573},{"w":"\"aw\",","start":227.079},{"w":"\"berry\".","start":227.586},{"w":"Keep","start":228.226},{"w":"that","start":228.546},{"w":"in","start":228.786},{"w":"mind;","start":228.986},{"w":"it","start":229.346},{"w":"comes","start":229.586},{"w":"back","start":229.866},{"w":"in","start":230.066},{"w":"a","start":230.226},{"w":"minute.","start":230.346}]}],"props":{"examples":[{"text":"Write a short poem about the rain","tokens":["Write"," a"," short"," 